{'symbol': 'MMM', 'date': '2022-08-29 18:33:00', 'title': '3M SETS FINAL EXCHANGE RATIO IN SPLIT-OFF EXCHANGE OFFER IN CONNECTION WITH NEOGEN TRANSACTION', 'text': 'ST. PAUL, MINN. , AUG. 29, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- 3M (NYSE: MMM) ANNOUNCED TODAY THE FINAL EXCHANGE RATIO OF 6.7713 FOR ITS SPLIT-OFF EXCHANGE OFFER TO 3M STOCKHOLDERS TO EXCHANGE THEIR SHARES OF 3M COMMON STOCK FOR SHARES OF COMMON STOCK OF GARDEN SPINCO CORPORATION ("SPINCO").'}